{"articleNo":"623","sourceUrl":"https://www.kumoh.ac.kr/ko/sub06_01_01_03.do?mode=view&articleNo=623&article.offset=0&articleLimit=10","title":"대학원 신입생 기숙사 합격자 안내","writer":"국립금오공과대학교","writeDate":"2009.01.24","hit":"17763","attachments":[],"contentHtml":"\n                \t\n\t\t\t\t\t\n                \n                \t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<p><strong><font color=\"#000000\" size=\"3\">대학원 신입생 기숙사 합격자 현황</font></strong></p>\n<p><strong><font color=\"#000000\" size=\"3\"></font></strong>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><strong><font color=\"#000000\" size=\"3\">응용화학:박부배,&nbsp;&nbsp; &nbsp;건축:여진동,&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; &nbsp;경영:박진한,&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </font></strong></p>\n<p><strong><font color=\"#000000\" size=\"3\">기계:이동명,&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; &nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; 정보나노:반태호,&nbsp;&nbsp; &nbsp; 정보나노:김동현,</font></strong></p>\n<p><strong><font color=\"#000000\" size=\"3\">물리:변성욱,&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; &nbsp;전자:김도석,&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; 전자:김준섭,</font></strong></p>\n<p><strong><font color=\"#000000\" size=\"3\">제어:박상신,&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; &nbsp;제어:이기엽,&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; 고분자:한재일,</font></strong></p>\n<p><strong><font color=\"#000000\" size=\"3\">고분자:김현태,&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; &nbsp;고분자:김진명&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; 고분자:이은우&nbsp;</font></strong></p>\n<p><strong><font color=\"#000000\" size=\"3\">고분자:엄효상,&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; &nbsp;토목:이강득(남 17명)&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </font></strong></p>\n<p><strong><font color=\"#000000\" size=\"3\">응용화학:변혜정&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; 경영:이다정&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; 고분자:복성희</font></strong><strong><font color=\"#000000\" size=\"3\"> (여3명)</font></strong></p>\n<p><strong><font size=\"3\"><font color=\"#000000\"></font></font></strong>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><strong><font size=\"3\"><font color=\"#000000\">학번이 부여되지 않은 관계로 고지서 출력이 되지 않으니 </font><font color=\"#dc143c\">입학처리(2009.2.20 예정)<font color=\"#000000\">가</font> </font></font></strong><strong><font size=\"3\"><font color=\"#000000\">되면&nbsp;기숙사 행정실에 오셔서 등록처리를 하시기 바랍니다</font>.</font></strong></p>\n<p><strong><font size=\"3\">★ 신입생은&nbsp;개인별로 통보할 수 없사오니 등록에 착오없으시기&nbsp;바랍니다.</font></strong></p>\n<p align=\"center\"><strong><font size=\"3\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;<font color=\"#000000\"> 2009. 1. 24.</font></font></strong></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p align=\"center\"><strong><font color=\"#000000\" size=\"3\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; 금오공과대학교기숙사사감장</font></strong></p>\n\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\n            "}
